    ['Helga']                            = { type = "Military Information", icon = "Dialogue.png", zones = { "Bastok", "Metalworks" }, note = "Notes:\nOffers Information on The Republican Military: Greetings, adventurer. I am Gold Musketeer first captain, Helga. Would you like me to give you a simple brefing on the Republican Military? Yes.> The Republican military is comprised of two groups: the Republican Legion and the Musketeers. the legionary forces are formed from volunteers and draftees, and are divided into four different organizations. It is these organizations that handle the responsibility of defending our nation from invasion. The Musketeers are an elite group of officers hand-selected from legion ranks. As with the legion, this group is also divided into several smaller units. Of those units, the two most prominent would be the Iron Musketeers, who answer directly to the Department of Industry, and the Gold Musketeers, who take their orders from the Department of Mining. No.> Ah, I suppose you are already and expert on the subject. My apologies." },
