    ['Volker']                           = { type = "Mythril Musketeer", icon = "Guard.png", zones = { "Bastok", "Battle", "Cutscene", "Cutscenes" }, note = "Involved in Quests:\n* Waking the Colossus\n* Trust: Bastok\n\nInvolved in Missions:\n* Bastok Mission 1-2: A Geological Survey\n* Bastok Mission 2-1: The Crystal Line\n* Bastok Mission 3-1: The Four Musketeers\n* Bastok Mission 3-2: To the Forsaken Mines\n* Bastok Mission 5-1: Darkness Rising\n* Bastok Mission 5-2: Xarcabard, Land of Truths\n* Bastok Mission 8-1: The Chains That Bind Us\n* Bastok Mission 9-2: Where Two Paths Converge\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 6: Easterly Winds\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 39: Allied Rumblings\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 47: The Empress Crowned\n\nNotes:\n* The champion of Bastok, believed by many to have delivered the final blow to the Shadow Lord at the end of the Great War. He is the Captain of the The Mythril Musketeers, and nephew of Ulrich. *Fights alongside you during the battle for Bastok Mission 9-2: Where Two Paths Converge. **Seems to have low HP but fairly high attack power; can deal decent damage, but can easily be one-shot by the enemy's weaponskills if not careful. Uses Vorpal Blade during combat. **Also uses a skill called Berserk-Ruf, which gives him (and only him) Warcry." },
