    ['Parcarin']                         = { type = "Dialogue NPC", icon = "Dialogue.png", zones = { "Port San d'Oria", "San d'Oria" }, note = "Involved in Quests:\n* Lure of the Wildcat (San d'Oria)\n\nNotes:\nDialogue: Heard the whispers, have you? The beastmen have a new leader. War is preparing! Ah, but any horde of beastmen will break upon these walls like water. Long live King Destin! If quest \"Lure of the Wildcat (San d'Oria)\" is active: I hear the town of Al Zahbi, a strategic location in the west of Aht Urhgan, often finds itself surrounded by invading beastman forces... What feeble defenses they must have in the Near East. This is what comes of a nation that does not embrace the path of chivalry. Our heroic knights would make short work of any beastman horde, no matter their number! Long live King Destin!" },
