    ['Shantotto']                        = { type = "Quest Giver", icon = "QuestGiver.png", zones = { "Windurst", "Windurst Walls" }, note = "Starts Quests:\n* Curses, Foiled Again!\n* Curses, Foiled...Again!?\n* Curses, Foiled A-Golem!?\n* Blood and Glory\n\nInvolved in Quests:\n* Nothing Matters\n* Wonder Wands\n* SMN AF2: Class Reunion\n* BLM AF1: The Three Magi\n* BLM AF2: Recollections\n* BLM AF3: The Root of the Problem\n* Lure of the Wildcat (Windurst)\n\nStarts Missions:\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 20: Teahouse Tumult\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 23: Social Graces\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 25: Playing the Part\n* An Errand! The Professor's Price\n* The Voracious Resurgence: Koru-Moru's Hypothesis\n\nInvolved in Missions:\n* Windurst Mission 8-2 The Jester Who'd Be King\n* Promathia Mission 3-3: The Road Forks\n* Promathia Mission 5-3: Three Paths\n* Where Messengers Gather (Ulmia Path)\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 19: Sweets for the Soul\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 20: Teahouse Tumult\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 21: Finders Keepers\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 22: Shield of Diplomacy\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 24: Foiled Ambition\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 39: Allied Rumblings\n* Aht Urhgan Mission 47: The Empress Crowned\n* A Crystalline Prophecy (Mission)\n* Curses! A Horrifically Harrowing Hex\n* A Shantotto Ascension\n* Project: Shantottofication\n* Kupipi's Dilemma (The Voracious Resurgence 2-1)\n\nNotes:\nSee also: Lady Shantotto Exposed! [http://finalfantasy.wikia.com/wiki/Dissidia_Final_Fantasy Dissidia Final Fantasy] / [http://finalfantasy.wikia.com/wiki/Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy Dissidia 012] 110px|right [http://finalfantasy.wikia.com/wiki/Shantotto/Dissidia Shantotto Dissidia Profile] Shantotto appears as a playable secret character in Dissidia: Final Fantasy as well as its prequel Dissidia 012. She is allied with Cosmos, Goddess of Harmony and is voiced by Megumi Hayashibara in the Japanese version. In the English version, she is voiced by Candi Milo. On the character unlock screen it says that Shantotto is a \"[Chainspeller] - Batters foes with incredibly powerful magical HP attacks.\" It is notable that [http://finalfantasy.wikia.com/wiki/Shantotto/Dissidia#HP_Attacks spell tiers for magical HP attacks] change once her Bravery reaches certain levels; the highest attacks being Ancient Magic. Character File Description from Dissidia: \"A war hero with immeasurable magical power. Former minister of the Orastery, then head of the Parliament of Patriarchs, in the original game, Shantotto was one of the top minds in the Federation of Windurst. It's said her pride is higher than the pinnacles of the Gustaberg range, and her temper hotter than the magma flowing forth from the mighty Mount Yuhtunga. Her age is unknown, and having thus far neglected to marry seems to be her only regret in life.\"" },
